    "concrete_problem": "Ordinary native signature warmup repeats locked prechecks before verification and competes for serialized admission locks.",
    "split_mechanism": "A distinct native performance purpose using a pinned published context for eligible primitive signature warming, with explicit fallback. Existing526owners remain byte-identical.",
